creation of commands file to list out all the commands of terraform
===================================================================
terraform -version = to check the version of terraform
terraform init = Initialize the Terraform working directory and download providers/modules.
terraform validate = to validate all the file & syntax is validate
terraform fmt = to reset the all the syntax of a .tf file
terraform plan = review what Terraform will create, modify, or destroy.
terraform apply -auto-approve = Apply without asking for confirmation.
terraform state list = listing out the resources all managed by terraform
